.TH WAVE-INFO 1 "" "MacWave" "MacWave Manual"

.SH NAME
wave-info \- Show author, description, homepage and the installed / available versions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wave info <package> [\-\-json|\-\-yaml|\-\-toml|\-\-raw]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show author, description, homepage and the installed / available
versions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Print the same fields as JSON
.TP
.B \-\-yaml
Print the same fields as YAML
.TP
.B \-\-toml
Print the same fields as TOML
.TP
.B \-\-raw
Print the index record as stored, without the formatting

.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
wave info jq
wave info jq --json
wave info jq --raw
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
wave(1)
